# BORGHERTZS_LOYAL_HANDS (jeuno 55): the two optional coffers' sections (status not available, main job SAM, the
# [AF]ZilartCoffer bit unset). Accepted by a GM, a level 75 SAM: QuicksandCaves's Treasure Coffer opens to
# MyochinHaidate (the item bypass; the result is the item): [AF]ZilartCoffer +8388608 (bit 23); TempleOfUggalepih's to
# MyochinDomaru: +16777216 (bit 24).
lists QuicksandCaves/Treasure_Coffer/onTrade TempleOfUggalepih/Treasure_Coffer/onTrade
char zone=QuicksandCaves pos=-144.9,1.9,448.1 job=SAM lvl=75
quest Jeuno.BorghertzsLoyalHands accepted
item QuicksandCofferKey
item UggalepihCofferKey
login
tick 13000                              # the coffer placed
trigger Treasure_Coffer                 # walks to the coffer
trade Treasure_Coffer QuicksandCofferKey x1 # bit 23 unset: MyochinHaidate; [AF]ZilartCoffer 8388608
tick 4500                               # the coffer opened
warp 219.7,-8.1,205.8 TempleOfUggalepih
tick 13000                              # the coffer placed
trigger Treasure_Coffer                 # walks to the coffer
trade Treasure_Coffer UggalepihCofferKey x1 # bit 24 unset: MyochinDomaru; [AF]ZilartCoffer 25165824
tick 4500                               # the coffer opened
